FON1

// a font definition file must always start with above FON1 header at the very beginning (no empty space in
// front) and it must be all uppercase

// the body of a font definition file is a list of parameters for describing the font's appearance

// TTF/OTF Resource
resource fonts/serif
// Antialias font (optional; enabled by default)
antialias 1
// Font size
height 8
// Font width (optional; useful if requesting a bitmap font of a certain size)
//width 8
// Font DPI (optional)
//dpi 75
// Scale font proportionally to current overlay (optional; disabled by default)
//dynamic 1

